WEBVTT

01:18.840 --> 01:20.060
Stand, you pigs!

01:20.060 --> 01:24.220
Don't you forget that you are the ones chosen to worship Kyouka-sama herself!

02:03.590 --> 02:05.950
The makeup isn't working too well today.

02:05.950 --> 02:10.070
Night-shift work is fun, but it's bothersome how it causes rough skin in the long run.

02:14.610 --> 02:15.320
What happened?

02:16.120 --> 02:17.360
Are you hurt?

02:17.580 --> 02:19.050
It's nothing.

02:19.530 --> 02:20.990
Nothing...

02:21.530 --> 02:22.760
Yuuka-chan.

02:30.340 --> 02:31.990
You can rely on me any time, you know.

02:32.920 --> 02:37.340
I can lend my chest as a place for you to cry, any time you need it.

02:38.440 --> 02:40.260
I won't even say, "Don't cry."

02:40.530 --> 02:41.720
In fact, cry.

02:41.720 --> 02:43.630
Cry, and let it all out.

02:54.170 --> 02:56.650
Is this a rebellion against Kyouka-sama?

02:58.360 --> 03:00.740
We'll blow the entire class up!

03:00.740 --> 03:04.120
Ouka! Wrap a hundred sticks of dynamite around you and dive into them!

03:04.120 --> 03:04.890
PLACEHOLDER

03:04.120 --> 03:07.150
Go! Charge, Ouka Bomb!

03:04.890 --> 03:08.660
If you want to act like a stupid terrorist, go do it yourself.

03:07.150 --> 03:11.000
Go expend your life on behalf of your family!

03:09.100 --> 03:11.760
Your classmates are being kind to you, right?

03:11.760 --> 03:12.540
Yup.

03:12.540 --> 03:16.040
You two said you'd keep your hands off, right?

03:17.670 --> 03:19.650
But, Father,

03:19.650 --> 03:25.170
if our third-rate acting proved worthless, then we have to do something.

03:25.170 --> 03:27.140
We'll have to kill them all, right?

03:28.800 --> 03:30.170
U-Um... Um...

03:30.170 --> 03:31.890
Did you just say third-rate acting?

03:32.810 --> 03:37.940
Are you desecrating the wonderful plan I thoroughly planned and directed?

03:38.810 --> 03:40.990
Mother, that was a slip of the tongue!

03:40.990 --> 03:45.070
Hyouka, stop wielding such a thing in the house.

03:45.230 --> 03:46.160
Excuse me!

03:47.930 --> 03:51.100
I'm sorry for making you all worry.

03:51.100 --> 03:53.440
But I'm fine.

03:53.440 --> 03:54.520
Yuuka...

03:54.880 --> 03:58.030
I can't rely on everyone forever.

03:58.390 --> 04:01.420
So I'm fine. I'm simply telling the truth.

04:01.590 --> 04:03.930
Yuuka-chan! You've become so strong!

04:03.930 --> 04:05.680
Did you hear that, Teika?

04:05.680 --> 04:10.810
Because my party took place, Yuuka has overcome her painful past and matured.

04:11.010 --> 04:14.730
Although, hearing you say it makes the growth a trivial matter...

04:14.730 --> 04:17.530
...but let's not go there.

04:36.990 --> 04:39.220
Ah, poor girl.

04:39.220 --> 04:43.210
A pitiful, comical, and helpless Solitude Doll.

04:43.210 --> 04:44.130
Nee-sama.

04:45.030 --> 04:46.090
I mean...

04:46.090 --> 04:48.100
Himemiya Senko-san.

04:48.100 --> 04:51.970
Oh. Oh my, my. You sadden me, Reiko-chan.

04:51.970 --> 04:55.510
You act like I'm a stranger.

04:56.100 --> 04:58.010
Was this all because of you?

04:58.520 --> 05:00.400
This isn't enough yet.

05:01.480 --> 05:04.360
I want to squeeze you to death.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.920
Please go home!

05:05.920 --> 05:08.280
I no longer have anything to do with the Himemiya!

05:08.280 --> 05:10.530
I finally found a family I can treasure!

05:12.200 --> 05:17.040
Oh, but where would you find a family that gets along better than the Himemiya?!

05:24.540 --> 05:28.600
Remember, how much we all played with you, Reiko-chan?

05:28.600 --> 05:29.800
That was "play"?

05:30.610 --> 05:32.270
You're crazy.

05:32.780 --> 05:34.650
Come back to the Himemiya.

05:34.650 --> 05:36.160
No, I won't go back!

05:36.160 --> 05:41.120
A fake family without any blood relations or bonds is bound to break apart one day.

05:41.490 --> 05:45.190
You will end up getting hurt more deeply and critically.

05:48.370 --> 05:50.370
I believe in everyone.

05:50.550 --> 05:52.710
I'm no longer a Himemiya!

05:52.710 --> 05:54.200
I'm Midarezaki Yuuka!

05:55.020 --> 05:58.030
How could an Oni like you possibly be loved?!

05:58.030 --> 06:01.000
I bet the so-called family you have now doesn't love you at all!

06:01.130 --> 06:02.700
You're being tricked!

06:03.460 --> 06:04.760
I pity you.

06:06.020 --> 06:07.170
Come back, do you hear?!

06:07.360 --> 06:09.120
Obey me like a dog.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.880
That's how I raised you, isn't it?

06:10.880 --> 06:14.600
Is pain the only way this Solitude Doll can communicate?

06:14.600 --> 06:18.660
Reiko-chan, you're not home, and Grandmother is scary.

06:18.660 --> 06:19.520
Same goes for Nii-sama.

06:19.970 --> 06:22.840
They all work up a temper if they can't hit you.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.580
They hit me!

06:24.580 --> 06:27.320
Why do I have to go through this?!

06:27.850 --> 06:29.090
You're strangling me...

06:29.090 --> 06:30.530
Stop...

06:30.700 --> 06:31.780
Unhand her!

06:33.100 --> 06:35.220
What do you think you're doing to my family?

06:35.650 --> 06:37.020
Dependin' on the situation,

06:37.020 --> 06:38.290
you're gonna see blood.

06:38.290 --> 06:39.360
Who are you?!

06:39.620 --> 06:41.540
A hero of justice, I suppose.

06:43.580 --> 06:46.870
Wasn't that way too cool of an appearance?

06:47.220 --> 06:48.660
Do you adore me now, Yuuka-chan?

06:50.770 --> 06:51.430
So...

06:51.900 --> 06:53.960
Who the hell are you?

06:53.960 --> 06:55.930
You got some business with my little sister?

06:56.340 --> 06:59.150
What's the deal with strangling as a way of showing love?

06:59.840 --> 07:03.110
I'm not entirely sure of your situation, but will you buzz off?

07:03.610 --> 07:05.430
I don't like pain.

07:05.810 --> 07:10.470
Honestly, I want to live without getting involved in any of these savage events.

07:10.470 --> 07:11.390
I won't give up!

07:11.390 --> 07:13.950
I will take her back to the Himemiya no matter what it takes.

07:14.220 --> 07:15.440
Himemiya?

07:15.960 --> 07:17.360
Himemiya as in...

07:17.360 --> 07:19.080
Oh, you didn't know?

07:19.080 --> 07:21.960
She's a child of the Himemiya, the House of Oni.

07:24.570 --> 07:27.030
Let me hear your name just for reference, insolent boy.

07:27.410 --> 07:29.520
I'm Kizakura Ginichi,

07:29.520 --> 07:30.550
Himemiya Senko-chan.

07:40.350 --> 07:42.440
Ah, god!

07:42.440 --> 07:47.050
I haven't spoken in a manly tone for such
a long time, so I'm getting heartburn now!

07:48.710 --> 07:50.380
So you were putting on an act.

07:51.330 --> 07:52.900
Nevermind that, Yuuka-chan.

07:52.900 --> 07:57.730
Today, I'll take a day off from work, so let's eat snacks, watch the TV, and laugh the night away.

07:57.730 --> 07:59.400
Thank you, Ginka-san.

07:59.800 --> 08:02.090
We're a family. It's only obvious.

08:05.610 --> 08:07.530
Ginka-san, may I ask a question?

08:07.530 --> 08:08.360
What is it?

08:08.860 --> 08:11.260
Why did you know her name?

08:11.260 --> 08:13.220
That her name's Himemiya Senko...

08:13.220 --> 08:15.550
Oh, did I say that?

08:15.960 --> 08:17.920
You're just imagining things.

08:20.640 --> 08:23.020
Special move, Pink Bomber!

08:25.740 --> 08:27.360
You're so strong, Yuuka-chan.

08:31.060 --> 08:31.860
See?

08:40.290 --> 08:42.240
This can't be. This can't be. This can't be.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.320
This can't be true.

08:43.880 --> 08:46.740
Kizakura Ginichi... Why is he...

08:47.160 --> 08:50.000
God, please help me.

08:54.270 --> 08:59.350
I was told this was the House of Oni,
but I didn't expect it to be this far from human.

08:59.780 --> 09:01.400
It must have been hard for you.

09:01.400 --> 09:03.480
What's your name?

09:04.110 --> 09:05.380
Senko.

09:05.380 --> 09:06.900
Himemiya Senko.

09:06.900 --> 09:08.340
Senko-chan, eh?

09:09.100 --> 09:11.580
I never forget anything I commit to memory.

09:16.750 --> 09:21.910
If you ever feel scared, hurt, or lonely, come look for me, any time you want.

09:23.120 --> 09:24.690
I won't say, "Don't cry".

09:25.220 --> 09:26.260
Just cry.

09:26.260 --> 09:29.790
Cry it out, feel better, and come play with me.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.910
My name is Kizakura Ginichi.

09:33.910 --> 09:35.040
Senko-chan.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.930
Mother, what are you doing?

09:42.930 --> 09:44.570
Who is Senko-chan?

09:45.700 --> 09:49.620
To babble a girl's name in your sleep!
Ginka, you're quite the stud.

09:49.620 --> 09:51.280
I heard you from the hallway.

09:51.280 --> 09:53.150
You woke me up for that?

09:53.150 --> 09:56.280
It's how parents worry about their children.

09:56.460 --> 09:57.930
More like curiosity.

09:58.850 --> 10:00.000
I was having a dream.

10:01.900 --> 10:05.830
I promised I'd save her, but I couldn't.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.330
That's crap.

10:07.620 --> 10:14.170
If you have time to talk like that, then go meet that girl and apologize, atone, or just forget about her forever.

10:14.810 --> 10:16.000
Mother.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.840
I'll come with you.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.130
No, thank you.

10:26.100 --> 10:28.570
He remembered me.

10:28.570 --> 10:30.800
He even called me Himemiya Senko.

10:32.520 --> 10:34.080
But I can't...

10:34.690 --> 10:36.680
He won't save me anymore!

10:36.680 --> 10:38.570
Since I'm an Oni!

10:38.570 --> 10:41.510
I can no longer cry in his arms.

10:45.110 --> 10:46.760
Hit her more!

10:46.760 --> 10:48.340
More! More! More!

10:48.340 --> 10:50.330
Soon, you just can't stop yourself.

10:51.320 --> 10:55.420
Father, Mother, Grandmother,
and Brother, too. They were all like that.

10:55.680 --> 10:57.630
All the pain and humiliation...

10:57.630 --> 11:01.010
Reiko-chan, you're supposed to be the one to take it all!

11:10.990 --> 11:13.380
You're simply selfish.

11:14.460 --> 11:19.360
Why can't you think of anything but
passing on the pain to those lower than you?

11:19.360 --> 11:21.320
You still disobey me?

11:21.840 --> 11:24.040
You were never that sort of child.

11:24.040 --> 11:26.230
You were supposed to be an obedient Solitude Doll!

11:26.230 --> 11:27.180
Yuuka-chan!

11:29.590 --> 11:30.830
Ginka-san.

11:36.450 --> 11:37.390
Damn it...

11:38.800 --> 11:41.230
Why do you do this, Senko-chan?

11:41.230 --> 11:42.050
Why?

11:43.440 --> 11:45.110
This is absolutely hilarious.

11:45.580 --> 11:46.570
It's idiotic.

11:48.490 --> 11:51.670
Die a solitary death, all alone in the world.

11:53.060 --> 11:53.820
Senko-chan?

11:53.820 --> 11:56.300
That's what your death would be, would it not?

11:56.300 --> 11:59.230
Ah, none for one and one for self.

11:59.400 --> 12:04.360
You who twist and distort the world's order and then survive off doing so.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.780
You shall return to Hell.

12:10.440 --> 12:12.190
Are you using your Cellphone?

12:12.190 --> 12:13.340
I don't know.

12:13.340 --> 12:17.790
I just followed you to see the face of
the woman you even speak of in your sleep.

12:18.590 --> 12:20.260
Then who is doing this?

12:20.260 --> 12:21.450
I don't know.

12:21.450 --> 12:26.020
But I feel like cursing her to death this very moment.

12:29.560 --> 12:30.890
Senko-chan!

12:58.310 --> 13:00.140
Am I dead?

13:00.140 --> 13:05.260
It all ended so easily, almost as if I had no reason to be born.

13:07.400 --> 13:08.820
Daughter of Oni.

13:08.820 --> 13:09.970
You dare cry?

13:10.230 --> 13:11.440
Who is this?

13:11.440 --> 13:13.400
A tear in an Oni's eye.

13:13.400 --> 13:16.470
Never. An Oni wouldn't cry even if it were beheaded.

13:16.470 --> 13:17.780
I don't want to die...

13:17.780 --> 13:19.280
I don't want to die.

13:19.280 --> 13:23.190
I'm not a god, so I cannot comprehend why you're crying.

13:23.390 --> 13:25.590
I'll let you keep your life a little while longer.

13:26.340 --> 13:31.830
Usually I'm not kind enough to let those who bare their fangs towards my family live, but...

13:32.980 --> 13:36.220
Ah, how amusing! I've become so kind.

13:37.420 --> 13:40.180
Have the thousand years made me naive?

13:40.180 --> 13:43.320
Or has the Family Frenzy softened my soul?

13:44.150 --> 13:46.280
Now, what do we do with her?

13:46.900 --> 13:50.010
Do you want to die cleanly, or do you want to die messily?

13:51.670 --> 13:57.770
If you want to die cleanly, I'll dose you with
some sleeping pills and bury you alive in a grave.

13:57.770 --> 14:01.370
If it works, you get to die before you wake up.

14:01.370 --> 14:03.150
If you want to die messily...

14:03.330 --> 14:05.900
No... I don't want to die...

14:05.900 --> 14:10.240
After persecuting the daughter of a god, you still wish to live, you lump of sin?!

14:10.240 --> 14:13.490
You have committed a crime no human can be forgiven for!

14:14.790 --> 14:16.210
Stop it, Kyouka.

14:17.110 --> 14:19.420
I won't kill her. I was just threatening her.

14:19.750 --> 14:23.240
If I let her learn what fear is,
she probably won't do anything again.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.210
I heard the story from Ginka.

14:25.210 --> 14:29.530
You may be a victim who was trampled by the name of Himemiya.

14:29.530 --> 14:31.350
You're so sweet as usual.

14:31.350 --> 14:33.920
If so, we can just crush the Himemiya.

14:33.920 --> 14:36.130
We're talking about the Himemiya. They're too strong of an opponent.

14:36.130 --> 14:38.630
A hopeless battle will only hurt everyone.

14:38.630 --> 14:40.160
Who is your wife?

14:40.760 --> 14:42.710
Kyouka-sama. The absolute God!

14:42.710 --> 14:44.540
Screw the Himemiya, the House of Oni.

14:44.540 --> 14:49.360
They're just lowly animals with lots of paper with ¥10,000 printed on it.

14:50.540 --> 14:55.010
No matter how arrogant they act,
lowly animals are only lowly animals.

14:55.010 --> 14:56.240
What's there to hesitate about?

14:56.710 --> 14:58.700
If there are jerks, we can annihilate them.

14:58.700 --> 15:00.710
If there are douchebags, get rid of them.

15:00.710 --> 15:03.030
Why are you giving up like that?

15:03.030 --> 15:04.170
Kyouka...

15:04.440 --> 15:06.670
Prepare for a party, everyone!

15:06.670 --> 15:08.720
We'll declare war against the Himemiya!

15:09.280 --> 15:11.590
I don't like trouble, if you ask me.

15:11.590 --> 15:13.610
We'll have you come with us.

15:13.610 --> 15:14.510
Me, too?

15:14.940 --> 15:17.530
Don't worry. I'll save you, too.

15:17.530 --> 15:20.100
It's my son's wish.

15:21.940 --> 15:26.690
Rest assured. As a most wonderful fact, I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

15:30.210 --> 15:31.320
How does it look over there?

15:31.510 --> 15:33.370
Paralysis wave sent.

15:33.370 --> 15:36.030
The security system is dead, Mother.

15:36.190 --> 15:38.910
Teika, do you have the assault path figured out?

15:39.380 --> 15:46.340
My eyes don't work well in the dark, but with Senko-dono's assistance I know where the guards' relief station is.

15:46.340 --> 15:48.710
It'd be better if everyone stayed here.

15:48.710 --> 15:49.910
Take me with you.

15:49.910 --> 15:50.910
Yuuka...

15:50.910 --> 15:53.100
I want to witness the end of the Himemiya.

15:53.470 --> 15:58.830
The moment what was tormenting you dies! Observing that is the best, you know?

15:59.930 --> 16:02.980
I may look like this, but I'm pretty strong, you know?

16:02.980 --> 16:05.860
Now, let the destruction, pleasure, and frenzy begin!

16:08.900 --> 16:09.900
Intruders!

16:09.900 --> 16:10.860
We have intruders!

16:10.860 --> 16:11.530
Fire!

16:13.190 --> 16:15.140
Gunfire all of a sudden, eh? What a greeting!

16:15.140 --> 16:17.780
Then I'll have to give my greetings accordingly, too.

16:18.410 --> 16:20.660
What is this? You're all too easy!

16:20.840 --> 16:22.460
Is "Oni" only a name?

16:22.460 --> 16:24.230
An Oni that doesn't enjoy the night is not an Oni!

16:24.230 --> 16:25.790
It's only a fool!

16:25.790 --> 16:27.630
Hyouka, make sure you go easy on them.

16:27.630 --> 16:28.780
Yeah, okay.

16:32.030 --> 16:34.380
Oops, I'm sorry! Did that hurt?

16:34.380 --> 16:36.460
Oh, a hottie.

16:36.870 --> 16:39.260
Gosh, they're so persistent.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.250
Take this.

16:40.620 --> 16:41.680
Ginichi-san?!

16:45.660 --> 16:46.730
Teika-kun!

16:46.730 --> 16:50.230
Take this, an attack by Leonardo da Vinci's Mona Lisa!

16:51.890 --> 16:54.200
Your ancestors would be happy to hear you lost to a work of art!

16:54.320 --> 16:56.610
What's with her unexplainable strength?

16:56.990 --> 16:58.570
You guys don't have enough real battle experience.

16:59.050 --> 17:03.500
People like you guys who've been indulging
in a peaceful life don't stand a chance against Kyouka-sama.

17:03.500 --> 17:06.040
Mother! Father! Are you all right?!

17:06.040 --> 17:07.120
Everyone!

17:07.120 --> 17:09.420
Hmm, this looks like it's real.

17:09.810 --> 17:10.670
Oh well.

17:11.780 --> 17:12.760
How could you?!

17:12.760 --> 17:14.390
It's just a picture.

17:14.390 --> 17:17.970
People will be happy if they think what's in the museum is the authentic one.

17:18.210 --> 17:21.680
Delusions such as pictures and money don't have value.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.600
They're all illusions.

17:23.660 --> 17:26.560
But there are things that are not illusions even though they're fabricated.

17:26.780 --> 17:29.490
Our family is happy and worthwhile.

17:30.100 --> 17:36.070
That rotten Heaven only had fake happiness, but it was worthless and wasn't real, either.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.110
Huh?

17:37.110 --> 17:39.070
Ouka, have you noticed?

17:39.070 --> 17:41.950
We're probably the happiest family in the world.

17:51.150 --> 17:52.800
Here's the last piece of business.

17:52.800 --> 17:54.920
Let's shoot off big fireworks.

17:54.920 --> 17:57.000
So it's finally over.

17:57.000 --> 17:58.920
I don't want any more ruckus.

17:58.920 --> 17:59.800
Nonsense!

17:59.800 --> 18:04.100
A non-rowdy life is like a curry without spice!

18:04.100 --> 18:06.270
And curry without spice is not curry!

18:06.270 --> 18:08.850
Therefore life is not life if it's not rowdy!

18:11.180 --> 18:13.980
Mother, it's about time you plug your ears.

18:13.980 --> 18:15.520
Or else, your eardrums will burst.

18:18.220 --> 18:22.490
Say things like that sooner, you blockhead!

18:30.600 --> 18:34.630
I'm sorry for not saving you earlier, Senko-chan.

18:35.340 --> 18:35.900
I'm...

18:35.900 --> 18:36.580
No...

18:37.190 --> 18:39.010
You remembered me.

18:40.340 --> 18:45.060
You remembered a promise you made to a little girl, and you saved her.

18:45.230 --> 18:47.440
You are my savior.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.560
You truly are the one.

18:54.760 --> 18:56.610
It's impossible.

18:56.610 --> 18:59.320
I can't become one of the Midarezaki.

18:59.320 --> 19:01.260
Nothing's impossible!

19:01.260 --> 19:05.130
You must rehab your mind among the Midarezaki!

19:05.130 --> 19:11.400
But before Operation Cozy Family started,
every human being went through DNA analysis.

19:11.400 --> 19:14.030
So there's no possibility of me being a Child of Enka.

19:14.030 --> 19:16.250
You give up on things too easily.

19:17.130 --> 19:23.800
How could you deny the possibility of your DNA mutating a second later and becoming that of a Child of Enka?

19:25.920 --> 19:27.060
Please begin.

19:27.250 --> 19:29.940
If the analysis says she's a Child of Enka,
the result will appear as red.

19:29.940 --> 19:32.330
If not, a green lamp will illuminate.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.070
See?

19:43.070 --> 19:44.870
So, what's the result?

19:45.030 --> 19:47.120
You saw it. It's red.

19:47.870 --> 19:48.990
In other words?

19:48.990 --> 19:50.200
She's a Child of Enka.

19:50.450 --> 19:52.670
What?! That was gre-

19:52.670 --> 20:01.420
Shut up! I used my Cellphone to manipulate
her sensory nerves so she sees green as red.

20:01.420 --> 20:03.590
Well, it is cheating, but I suppose...

20:04.770 --> 20:06.640
I'm getting too used to her.

20:06.640 --> 20:09.450
The world is composed of irresponsibility and fraud.

20:09.450 --> 20:14.940
Since you've become my daughter, you have to learn to be able to lie with a straight face.

20:14.940 --> 20:17.060
You guys are unbelievable.

20:20.850 --> 20:22.950
Welcome to the Midarezaki family.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.440
Hold on just one moment.

20:29.100 --> 20:30.240
I'm sorry.

20:30.600 --> 20:33.330
I hated you, Reiko-chan.

20:34.810 --> 20:37.230
No, actually, I was jealous of you.

20:37.230 --> 20:41.460
I lived just like you did, yet you were able to become happy.

20:41.880 --> 20:45.840
You gained a new family that's not composed of Oni and was smiling.

20:47.220 --> 20:48.650
That's why I hurt you.

20:48.650 --> 20:52.020
I slammed my stupid, childish envy at you...

20:52.020 --> 20:53.060
Hurting you...

20:54.010 --> 20:54.850
I'm sorry.

21:07.990 --> 21:10.660
I guess you're the really strong one, Reiko-chan.

21:13.120 --> 21:16.540
Okay! Starting today, you're Midarezaki Chika!

21:17.620 --> 21:18.510
Chika?

21:19.890 --> 21:21.380
Midarezaki Chika...

21:23.110 --> 21:27.160
The Himemiya built a great debt from having their house demolished,

21:27.160 --> 21:30.200
and as a result, they were absorbed into the Wakarazunomiya, the head family,

21:30.200 --> 21:32.680
and for all intents and purposes, they were disbanded.

21:33.060 --> 21:37.400
This time around, you didn't do anything, did you, Gekka?

21:37.770 --> 21:40.960
Gekka-chan's a girl, so she's moody.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.320
How do you know Gekka's a girl?

21:43.280 --> 21:44.690
Womanly instinct, I suppose.

21:49.320 --> 21:50.530
Remember this.

21:50.780 --> 21:56.810
If you lose your wits and stain even your tears in evil,

21:56.810 --> 21:59.670
then that shall be the end of your life.

22:00.320 --> 22:01.670
Could it be you...

23:40.430 --> 23:41.350
This is Yuuka.

23:41.350 --> 23:43.830
I simply love Mom.

23:44.270 --> 23:47.320
What I like her about the most is... is...

23:47.320 --> 23:48.610
It's...

23:48.610 --> 23:49.990
How she's always full of energy!

23:50.710 --> 23:54.430
Next time: Make Sure You Plan Ahead Whether It Be a Trip Or a Curse.
